<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 John</para>
  <para style="toc1">eljwab eθθani n yuwHenne</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Jhn</para>
  <para style="toc3">2JN</para>
  <para style="mt1">eljwab eθθani n yuwHenne</para>
  <para style="ip">elγerD: eyekkeδ f essas n eθbaε n elmesiyH, elHeq d exse, d enebbeh seg imuεelmen imzeyfen. elli yuri: emersal yuwHenna. elli yemmeryasen: y temeTTuθ temsemme kiriyye welle temeTTuθ elli temmexθar, wellan elli eqqaren y icθ seg elknayes. esbeb n tires: temeTTuwθe d iθbab n elHuces kanen seg elkeniyseθ elli lahi essis yuHenne eδwlen SHab egget. heδake εlac yuHenne yetnebbeh δiys seg imuεelmen imzeyfen elli kanen mujudiyn g elknayes.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="s">etteHiyyeθ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />seg emeqqar yuHenne y temettuθ elli yexθariθ rebbi, d idreriys elli neč exsexθen elkul s elHeq, w muc kan δ neč exsexθen yemenni elli essenen elHeq elkul. <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />εlexaTer elHeq mujuwd g ulewnenne, w eyeqqiym iδne ellexxer. <verse eid="2JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />eyendeγ y nečin enneεmeθ d erreHmeθ d eslam deθkuwn iδne, seg rebbi deddaθne d yesuwε elmesiyH, s elHeq d exse.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">elHeq d exse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />w geddac iferHe max i zriyγ lebHaD n idrerix egguwren f elHeq emmax i xeniweSSe rebbi. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />w ture eDelbe essim eθemettuθ temeHbubθ bac ayexs beεeDne beεD. w θah mehic δ elwSayeθ ettejδit emetterye ture, yemenni δ elwSayeθ θkan γenne seg elbδu. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />w elmeεne n exse kan δ teyuwriθ g ebriδ n elwSayas, w elwSayeθdiyn max i tteslim seg elbδu netteθ eθuyuwrem g ebriδ n exse.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />welan leεbeδ egget effeγen bac e nnen edwi δ elγaleĎ g kul blaSe, w diysen elli ettesθeεrifenc elli yesuwε elmesiyH yuseδ y elqeεεeθ s elbδen n elεebδ, wah eyendeγ erruwH n elεδu w g eDDed n elmesiyH! <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />erreθ elbelewwem bac e ltxesremc eθθemraθ n elxeδemtenne, yemenni bac e θerbHem ellejr δ elkamel <verse eid="2JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />w elli eyeθεedde f edwi n elmesiyH w eliθebbeθc δiys, yetkunc rebbi iyδes. w elli eyeθbeθ f edwi n elmesiyH, eykuwn rebbi deddaθne d yesuwε memmis iyδes. <verse eid="2JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />w iδekan yusδawem iyjen s edwi xlaf, etteqblemc γerwem w esθennemc: eslam fellex. <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />w elli eysellem felles eθicarex g elεmeyles θimuHacin.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">elxatmeθ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />w γeri elberceθ δ edwi exse exentterye yemenni elγisexc eykuwn δ elHbar f lewraq εlexaTer exse eddase etweliwwem usinc exennuθlaye uwδem y uwδem usinc eθkuwn elferHθenne ettelkamelt. <verse eid="2JN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />etselmen fellex idrari n weltmex elli δ temexθar γer rebbi.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>